{"full":"hf:Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system","spaceId":"Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system","name":"ai-recruitment-system","source":"huggingface","description":"ai-recruitment-system","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["streamlit","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":9,"created":"2025-03-24T13:59:54.000Z","updated":"2025-03-24T14:44:39.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://thanos51-ai-recruitment-system.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:39:15.053Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:39:15.053Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:39:15.053Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🚀","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The AI Recruitment System is an advanced, AI-driven hiring platform built in Python to automate and optimize the recruitment process. Powered by Llama 3.x (via Groq’s API) and the CrewAI multi-agent framework, it offers a suite of tools accessible through a Streamlit web interface. The system handles everything from creating detailed job descriptions to conducting AI-driven interviews, making it an efficient solution for modern hiring needs.","The system incorporates a Model Context Protocol (MCP) to maintain state across its components. MCP uses Streamlit’s session state (st.sessionstate.mcpcontext) to store critical outputs—like job descriptions, ranked resumes, scheduled times, and interview transcripts—enabling seamless data flow between tabs without persistent storage. This enhances workflow efficiency and ensures context is preserved throughout the hiring process.","The system prioritizes ethical AI practices, such as bias avoidance and in-memory data processing for privacy (via MCP), and uses simulated APIs for email and calendar functions."],"features":["Detailed Job Description Generation: Produces comprehensive job postings with multiple sections.","Resume Ranking: Evaluates resumes for job fit with bias mitigation.","Personalized Email Automation: Sends AI-generated, tailored emails (e.g., interview invites).","Interview Scheduling: Schedules interviews based on candidate availability, with an AI chatbot interviewer.","Interview Agent: Conducts interactive interviews and evaluates responses."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"05d37787adb5ebc30e038fee4e712369303b5e6b21bbd72e835a4d2610fafcd2","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:16.741Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:39:15.232Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The AI Recruitment System is an advanced, AI-driven hiring platform built in Python to automate and optimize the recruitment process. Powered by Llama 3.x (via Groq’s API) and the CrewAI multi-agent framework, it offers a suite of tools accessible through a Streamlit web interface. The system handles everything from creating detailed job descriptions to conducting AI-driven interviews, making it an efficient solution for modern hiring needs.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"05d37787adb5ebc30e038fee4e712369303b5e6b21bbd72e835a4d2610fafcd2","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:39:15.232Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-03-24T14:44:39.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Thanos51/ai-recruitment-system/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:39:15.232Z","hash":"05d37787adb5ebc30e038fee4e712369303b5e6b21bbd72e835a4d2610fafcd2","originalBytes":10513,"storedBytes":10513,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["mcp","interview","job","context","candidate","detailed","e.g.","sentiment","llama","role","email","output","agent","system","functionality","hire","hiring","resume","re